@startuml F0.2-b-reset-email-inexistente
title F0.2-b — Solicitar reset (e-mail não cadastrado) — anti-enumeração
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Usuário" as Usuario
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "AuthController" as AuthController
participant "ForgotPasswordUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Usuario -> WebApp: e-mail inexistente / Enviar link
WebApp -> AuthController: POST /auth/recuperar-senha
AuthController -> UC: execute(email, ip)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT usuario BY email
Postgres --> UC: vazio

note right of UC
  Sem JWT, sem outbox_event
  Zero e-mails disparados
end note

UC -> Postgres: INSERT audit_log\n(tentativa, e-mail ofuscado)\nRN-F0.2-07
UC --> AuthController: ok
AuthController --> WebApp: 202 Accepted
WebApp --> Usuario: mesmo banner do F0.2-a\n(RN-F0.2-01)

@enduml
